Read `AGENTS.md` first; it is the canonical source of instructions for FarmIQ. Before coding, read the relevant documents in `docs/`, inspect existing code, and check `TASKS.md`. Preserve working functionality, follow `docs/CODING_STANDARDS.md` and `docs/SECURITY.md`, add tests, run relevant checks, and update task status and `CHANGELOG.md`. Never invent live data or source citations.
